{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203310","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203310","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1320331001:1":{"text":"あら？あなたは以前会ったサイレンシアさん？","source_cn":"咦？你是我们之前见到的那位奇花侍者吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA30E6BB8525294C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320331002:1":{"text":"恐らく違うかと。皆様は最近よく荘園にいらしているようですが、こうしてお話するのは初めてです。","source_cn":"我想应该不是。虽然诸位最近常来永寂庄园，但我从未与您搭过话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCB99E5C62A0A3FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320331003:1":{"text":"確かに別人ですね。前回会った方は恥ずかしがり屋さんでしたもの。","source_cn":"难怪你说话的语气不一样呢。之前那位侍者似乎很胆小！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DCB2031822BABBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320331004:0":{"text":"恥ずかしがり屋……ああ、画材の整理を担当している子ですね。","source_cn":"胆小的奇花侍者……啊，想必是几日前凋零的那位。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA5C23E714757E13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320331005:0":{"text":"最近少し落ち込んで疲れが見えるものの、まだ枯れる段階ではありませんので、ご安心ください。","source_cn":"他最近有些疲惫，情绪也有些低落。但请不必担心，他还没有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BDA4C00A38253FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320331006:0":{"text":"え！？か、枯れてしまうんですか！？","source_cn":"等等……奇花侍者会凋零？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB17EBE26AF6CB743","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320331007:0":{"text":"はい。子爵様に魔法で体と自我をいただいても、サイレンシアであることには変わりませんから。多少寿命は延びても、いずれ枯れるのが花の宿命――","source_cn":"是的。虽然子爵先生用魔法赋予了我们身躯与意识，但本质上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF632AF59F671CDC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320331008:0":{"text":"と子爵様は仰っていました。","source_cn":"——这些话是子爵先生告诉我的，我很努力才记下来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E339DE9FE3344DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320331009:0":{"text":"それに、なぜか子爵様は、我々サイレンシアが羨ましいとも言っていました。いつかは枯れる日が来るのが羨ましいと……","source_cn":"不过，不知道为什么，子爵先生竟然说他很羡慕我们这些永寂...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A04DF256BDDF76A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320331010:0":{"text":"でも私にはその意味が理解できません。子爵様のお言葉は本当に奥が深いです……","source_cn":"这句话我到现在都没能理解。先生的想法总是很深奥……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D2F47940B79FC64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docum